1. When the comment is empty, an empty line gets appended — need to skip the empty comment.
2. The "to catch" loop is off: for verse v, the chain should start from animal v-1 (the one before the current animal) and go down to 0. In the case of verse 2 (spider, index 1), the chain should be "She swallowed the spider to catch the fly." — that is, the chain lines refer to the current animal and everything before it. My loop starts from i = v-2, but it should start from i = v-1.

Also, the horse verse (v=8) should not have any chain lines at all.

